<li>analyze possible property chains and transaction dependencies;</li>
<li>identify possible buyers, sellers, properties, conditions, weak points, stalled stages, or Missing Links;</li>
<li>search configured internet sources or connected feeds for potentially similar properties;</li>
<li>generate compatibility, readiness, similarity, or Chain Confidence scores;</li>
<li>create public or private property requests and Missing Link Ads;</li>
<li>provide controlled workspaces for participants, agents, and administrators;</li>
<li>support communication, verification indicators, campaign distribution, and progress tracking.</li>
</ul>
<p>EST8ADS may add, change, limit, test, or discontinue features. Beta or experimental features may be incomplete, inaccurate, or changed without notice.</p>
