<section class="legal-section" id="fees">
<h2>4. Fees, 30-day publishing and payment</h2>
<h3>Private and one-time users</h3>
<p>The current standard price is <strong>US$12 for one 30-day property-move publication period</strong>. The fee covers publication of one property-move request and access to EST8ADS AI Server analysis for that request. It is a technology and advertising service fee, not a real estate commission.</p>
<h3>Real estate agencies using Villa Bit AI</h3>
<p>Real estate agencies with an eligible active Villa Bit AI service may receive unlimited EST8ADS publishing through the integrated Villa Bit AI Server, subject to the agency’s Villa Bit AI plan, fair-use limits, technical availability, and separate Villa Bit AI terms.</p>
<h3>No commission</h3>
<p>EST8ADS does not claim a percentage of the property price or a commission merely because a property is bought or sold through an opportunity identified by the Service. Any brokerage, referral, professional, or agency fee is governed by the separate agreement with the relevant licensed provider.</p>
<h3>Taxes and payment processing</h3>
<p>Prices may be shown without or with applicable taxes depending on the user’s location and checkout configuration. Payment may be processed by an independent payment provider. We generally do not receive full payment-card details.</p>
<h3>Renewal and expiry</h3>
<p>A 30-day publication is one-time and does not automatically renew unless the checkout clearly states that recurring billing applies and you expressly agree. After expiry, the request may be unpublished, archived, or require a new payment or eligible plan.</p>
</section>

<section class="legal-section" id="withdrawal">
<h2>5. EU/EEA consumer withdrawal and refunds</h2>
<p>If you are an EU/EEA consumer purchasing online, you may have a statutory 14-day right to withdraw from a service contract. If you ask us to begin publication and AI analysis immediately during that period, you may be required to pay for the portion already supplied. If the service is fully performed, the right of withdrawal may end only where the legally required express consent and acknowledgement have been obtained.</p>
<p>Before activating an immediate paid service for an EU/EEA consumer, checkout should include an unticked consent confirming the request for immediate performance and the relevant withdrawal consequences.</p>
<p>Outside mandatory statutory rights, fees are generally non-refundable after a request has been published or substantive AI processing has begun. We may provide a refund or credit where the Service was not supplied because of our technical failure.</p>
<div class="legal-callout warning"><p><strong>Checkout implementation requirement:</strong> The production payment flow must display the total price, duration, main service characteristics, payment obligation, withdrawal information, and any immediate-performance consent before payment.</p></div>
</section>

