<p>EST8ADS uses automated systems and AI-assisted analysis to compare property requirements, locations, prices, descriptions, conditions, dependencies, and other data. The system may generate similarity scores, Chain Confidence, readiness indicators, estimated values, candidate chains, Missing Links, summaries, and recommendations.</p>
