<p>EST8ADS does not intend to make a solely automated decision that creates a binding legal obligation to buy, sell, finance, approve, reject, or transfer a property. Participants and their authorized professionals make all final decisions. Where applicable law provides rights regarding automated decision-making or profiling, you may request information, object, or request human review through the Contact page.</p>
</section>

